title: A new roadmap for [+ player_party +]
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: broken_roadmap_expires_trigger or (roadmap_year = 0 and year > 2012)
role: event

= A new roadmap for [+ player_party +]

We have no current deadline for our [+ roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap to independence. Without it, we can hardly have any credibility that we will achieve anything we are proposing. What should we be aiming at?

- @next_two_years
- @next_four_years
- @next_election
- @decade_end

@next_two_years
title: This cannot wait, we'll achieve our goals in the coming couple years!
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmap_year = Q.year+2; 
    Q.ciu_relations += 3; 
    Q.erc_relations += 8; 
    Q.cup_relations += 8;
    Q.independence_trust += 7;
!}

We've promised to fulfill our roadmap to independence before [+ roadmap_year +]. Let's hope we did not overpromise...

@next_four_years
title: We'll accomplish our roadmap by [+ year + 4 +]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmap_year = Q.year+4; 
    Q.ciu_relations += 3; 
    Q.erc_relations += 3; 
    Q.cup_relations += 5;
    Q.independence_trust += 5;
!}

In our new stated goals and political programme, we are now promising that meaningful progress will be done before [+ roadmap_year +].

@next_election
title: We'll do meaningful progress during this legislature!
view-if: next_election_year - year > 2
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmap_year = Q.next_election_year; 
    Q.ciu_relations += 3; 
    Q.erc_relations += 3; 
    Q.cup_relations += 5;
    Q.independence_trust += 5;
!}

We've promised to fulfill our roadmap to independence within this legislature. Let's hope we did not overpromise...

@decade_end
title: There's no rush, we will do it within this decade
view-if: year < 2017
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmap_year = 2020; 
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 2; 
    Q.cup_relations -= 5; 
    Q.erc_relations -=2; 
    Q.psc_relations += 2; 
    Q.cup_relations -= 5;
    Q.independence_trust -= 10;
!}

We have decided to keep it safe and set our goal to the end of the decade. Needless to say, this is a bit disappointing for many, let's hope this is not too slow for our voters.
